vy7L0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWTuL7nz_jVpwwbYBgoyy3QdOynL6cXoY3zcvr-qCsjA&oe=6AFC94A6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "video-thumb.png", "id": "896068849090374", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_896068852423707_6468028910789789512_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c-LWRs6CTA0Q7kNvwG-qVeU&_nc_oc=AdpF7ATERtuRZ5MIF_jhTG0dvu-UycMQlfOGZskB6QtvRKoYmdGAO1byxrD9jvY58wk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQnEq3N0UO0kI7lEkdTBplO4ph9Ow3AwwFjnsh64ert6w&oe=6AFC7014"}, "display_name": "BTI: VR Training", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Key Features:\n\nHands-On Learning: Enhance your hands-on experience with a realistic virtual lab setting, ideal for BTI\u2019s BioSTART and Laboratory Associates Program.\n\nSelf-Paced Learning: Progress through learning modules at your own pace with built-in evaluations, ensuring you develop competencies before advancing.\n\nHaptic Feedback: Feel like you're performing real tasks with tactile feedback from the controllers.\n\nInstructor Monitoring: Instructors can track your progress and practice frequency, ensuring a smooth transition from virtual to real-world competency.\n\nAccessibility: Break down traditional barriers to training, providing more opportunities for underrepresented demographics.\n\nAdult Learning Principles: The program aligns with the principles of adult learning for effective skill development.", "short_description": "BTI VR Training is a cutting-edge training tool for the biotechnical sector, ideal for those entering the biotech industry. It combines practical lab simulations with interactive theoretical lessons, providing a comprehensive learning experience. This application is a key resource for acquiring essential lab skills, serving as a bridge to the dynamic biotech world."}]}, "developer_name": "Capitol Interactive LLC", "develo